flowchart TD
    S[Local PNG / JPEG / multi-page PDF + explicit metadata] --> P[Every physical page]
    P --> V[Google Vision OCR adapter: sync / async]
    V --> R[Raw response + all blocks + polygons + confidence]
    R --> C[Atomic raw OCR checkpoint when enabled]
    R --> Q[Whole-page reconstruction and cleanup request]
    Q --> I[Shared inference: sync / async logical batches]
    I --> A[Validate exact block coverage and ad associations]
    A -->|valid| B[Raw ads + cleaned ads + source spans]
    A -->|invalid / failed| E[Checkpoint failure and stop later batches]
    B --> J[Atomic outcomes/CSV per batch or on completion]
    J --> H[Human scan comparison / inspection]
    H --> D[Existing DatasetLoader]
    C -. compatible resume .-> Q
    J -. skip successful pages .-> Q
